{"3130980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Three Alpha One Nine", "steam_appid": 3130980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME THREE ALPHA ONE NINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras/d8c77b8e688ff4e352bb0bd789e49d76.avif?t=1781115524\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras_big/d8c77b8e688ff4e352bb0bd789e49d76.webp?t=1781115524 width=1560 height=667 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll play as 3A19, a specialized robot designed by IMI Energy Solutions to &quot;collect Energy Cells&quot; located throughout time and space.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Main levels, each with their own unique locale and soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Hardcore variations of each level with new aesthetics and a significantly harder difficulty. (You will likely <strong>NEVER</strong> be able to complete most of these, maybe)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden &quot;SSD Drives&quot; that reveal the truth about your employer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge levels to put your skills to the test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization and ranking system to reward speed, precision, and curiosity </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALL FUTURE UPDATES AND CONTENT WILL BE FREE</strong><br><strong></strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventure you will encounter various enemies and tricky environments that will test your abilities to the limits. You will likely <strong>NOT</strong> survive your first attempts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras/914ab4ffc8f39e85d58a72211bc0bfc9.avif?t=1781115524\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras_big/914ab4ffc8f39e85d58a72211bc0bfc9.avif?t=1781115524 width=1560 height=666 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is NOT a casual platformer, but this is NOT impossible.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras/e3f7e2794d636eb5261bbc67e864230c.avif?t=1781115524\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras_big/e3f7e2794d636eb5261bbc67e864230c.webp?t=1781115524 width=1560 height=667 /></span><br><strong>Every second counts, every jump requires precision, and every defeat is just another step towards glory.</strong><br> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras/db35bf10f3cf81124552063ccdf887af.avif?t=1781115524\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras_big/db35bf10f3cf81124552063ccdf887af.webp?t=1781115524 width=1560 height=667 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you up for the test?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Good Luck</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME THREE ALPHA ONE NINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras/d8c77b8e688ff4e352bb0bd789e49d76.avif?t=1781115524\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130980/extras_big/d8c77b8e688ff4e352bb0bd789e49d76